# Managed by Ansible (disk_guard). noqa: nas-scheduled-job: a user timer on the T3 remotes (the NAS is one), like agent_workspace's; the owner asked for it (8 Nov 2026)
[Unit]
Description=Run the disk guard every hour

[Timer]
OnBootSec=10min
OnUnitActiveSec=1h
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
